    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36985" root="كسر" body-key="k">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُنْكَسِرٌ</span></b>  has for its pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكَاسِيرُ</span>, which is extr.;
like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسَاحِيقُ</span>, pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُنْسَحِقٌ</span>. (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سحق</span>.)
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَأَيْتُهُ مُنْكَسِرًا</span> (tropical:)  <i>I saw him in a languid,</i> or <i>languishing state.</i> (A.)

